# Ask the network — web

Next.js App Router scaffold for the clinical-instrument design system.

## Run

```bash
cd web
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) for the token specimen.

## Structure

- `app/` — layout, globals, specimen page
- `components/ds/` — Button, CodeChip, Panel, DisclosureRail, TypeSpecimen
- `lib/tokens.ts` — typed token names
